    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPS: Multiplayer is an online shooter game with 7 different game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Conquest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Search &amp; Destroy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Kill Confirmed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Rush</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Team Deathmatch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Free 4 All</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Capture the Flag</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge? You can also play offline, completely stress-free, against AI players (bots) with 3 different difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Requests and suggestions for improvement are always welcome!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FPS: Multiplayer is an online shooter game with 7 different game modes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Conquest</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Search &amp; Destroy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Kill Confirmed</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Rush</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Team Deathmatch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Free 4 All</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Capture the Flag</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge? You can also play offline, completely stress-free, against AI players (bots) with 3 different difficulty levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Requests and suggestions for improvement are always welcome!</p>",
